&lt;p&gt;If you share our values and our enthusiasm for building the world’s best search &amp;amp; discovery technology, we’d love to review your application!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Algolia, we’re proud to be a pioneer and market leader in AI Search, empowering 18,000+ businesses to deliver blazing-fast, predictive search and browse experiences at internet scale. Every week, we power over 30 billion search requests — four times more than Microsoft Bing, Yahoo, Baidu, Yandex, and DuckDuckGo combined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In 2021, we raised $150 million in Series D funding, quadrupling our valuation to $2.25 billion. This strong foundation enables us to keep investing in our market-leading platform and serving incredible customers like Under Armour, PetSmart, Stripe, Gymshark, and Walgreens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an Employee Experience Specialist to shape and continuously improve the experiences that matter most across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Initially focused on onboarding, employee listening, and engagement, you&#39;ll partner across People, IT, Workplace, Talent Acquisition, and business leaders to create programs that are measurable, scalable, and engaging. You&#39;ll combine data, technology, and employee feedback to improve how employees experience Algolia from day one through key career milestones.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Success in this role means creating experiences that increase employee engagement, strengthen manager effectiveness, and enable the People team to operate more efficiently through thoughtful design, automation, and continuous improvement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Onboarding:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and continuously improve the end-to-end onboarding experience for new hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design programs that accelerate engagement, connection, and early productivity during the first 30, 60, and 90 days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use employee feedback and business metrics to identify opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition, People Operations, IT, Workplace, Learning &amp;amp; Development, and business leaders to deliver a seamless onboarding experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate onboarding communications, workflows, and employee touchpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Listening:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the execution and continuous improvement of engagement, pulse, onboarding, and lifecycle surveys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver timely reporting and actionable insights to leaders and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop communications, resources, and action-planning materials that help leaders turn feedback into action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish governance that creates a consistent, scalable employee listening strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Employee Experience:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze employee feedback and program data to identify trends, risks, and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate qualitative and quantitative insights into recommendations that improve engagement, retention, and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure program effectiveness and continuously improve key employee lifecycle experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help build a connected employee lifecycle across onboarding, development, engagement, internal mobility, and offboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify friction points and recommend scalable improvements that enhance the employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use employee feedback, operational data, and stakeholder insights to inform future program design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify, standardize, and automate Employee Experience programs and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage AI and automation to improve onboarding, employee communications, survey administration, reporting, and insight generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with IT and system owners to optimize tools, integrations, and employee experience technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work at least 2 days per week in our NYC office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing or improving employee experience programs, onboarding, engagement, or employee listening initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate employee feedback into actionable recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills with experience creating reports, presentations, and stakeholder communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering across multiple teams to deliver programs and influence outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A continuous improvement mindset, with experience simplifying processes through technology, automation, or AI&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort working with employee experience platforms, survey tools, collaboration technologies, and reporting systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Lattice, Seismic, or similar employee experience platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global or distributed organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI-enabled productivity tools and workflow automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing employee journey maps or lifecycle frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within your first year, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a consistent, measurable onboarding experience that improves new hire readiness and engagement&lt;/li&gt;
