&lt;li&gt;Track record negotiating complex, multi-year enterprise agreements directly with customers and internal stakeholders (legal, finance, deal desk)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration skills with Customer Success, Solutions Engineers, and other cross-functional teams to proactively address customer needs, remove blockers, and to drive outcomes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort managing complex, multi-stakeholder relationships within large organizations, with the strategic patience for longer sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
