&lt;li&gt;A passion for leading by example and encouraging a healthy work environment that is both supportive and challenging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A coach&#39;s mindset — known for developing people and consistently raising the bar on team execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know when to let a team work through problems and when to jump in to help&lt;/li&gt;
