&lt;li&gt;Strong desire to help solve problems with the ability to explain complex technical concepts to a broad audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years experience in a customer-facing technical role (SE, SA, consultant, PM), ideally in the SaaS space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous software development experience in one or more of the following areas:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Front End: JavaScript, TypeScript, React,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Back-End: Java, Ruby, Go, Node, Python, Swift/Objective-C&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data modeling, data transformation and enrichment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great oral and written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience delivering technical presales workshops of various nature (discovery, education, product demonstration)&lt;/li&gt;
