&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years experience in a customer-facing technical role (SE, SA, consultant, PM), ideally in the SaaS space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bilingual fluency in Portuguese (Spanish: nice to have skill set)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous software development experience in one or more of the following areas:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
